{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18033","headline":"感春五首 五 · 韩愈","name":"感春五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辛夷花房忽全开，将衰正盛须频来。\n清晨辉辉烛霞日，薄暮耿耿和烟埃。\n朝明夕暗已足叹，况乃满地成摧颓。\n迎繁送谢别有意，谁肯留恋少环廻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}